[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Rocket.Chat 8 is in %%WWWDIR%% (owned by root), run by the rc script
rocketchat8 as the user %%USERS%% with the environment of
%%PREFIX%%/etc/rocketchat8.conf (its sample: rocketchat8.conf.sample):
NAME=value lines, not run as sh, root:wheel 600; its output goes to
/var/log/rocketchat8.log.

It needs MongoDB 8.0 (databases/mongodb80, here or on another host) as a
replica set. In %%LOCALBASE%%/etc/mongodb.conf:

  replication:
    replSetName: rs01

then, once mongod runs with it: mongosh --eval 'rs.initiate()'

  sysrc rocketchat8_enable=YES
  service rocketchat8 start

The DDP transport of uWebSockets.js (DDP_TRANSPORT=uws) has no FreeBSD
build: the default one, sockjs, is used.
EOM
}
]
